      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-25T06:50:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well technically you could use Load, Hostage situation would prevent you from playing a card, so it wouldn't accomplish anything, but you could still use Load.</p><p>Just like you could play flame blast if Ra could not deal damage, Flame Blast wouldn't have any effect, but you could play it. (did that with someone in a game vs. akash with Surprise Shopping trip in play to get the SST damage to finish off a limb)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edited for clarity.</p>",
